@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml
title Pay for Order (VNPAY) Sequence Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ActivationBorderColor #333333
    ActivationBackgroundColor #70C5E8
}

actor "Customer" as A
boundary "Spring Security" as SEC
control "PaymentController" as CT
control "PaymentService" as SV
entity "OrderRepository / PaymentRepository" as REPO
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "VNPAY sandbox" as VNPAY

autonumber

A -> SEC: POST /api/v1/payments/vnpay/create with orderId and customer JWT
activate SEC
note over SEC
validate the JWT and load AuthUser into the SecurityContext
end note
SEC -> CT: Forward authenticated CUSTOMER principal
deactivate SEC
activate CT
CT -> SV: Create a VNPAY retry with orderId, caller id and client IP
activate SV
SV -> REPO: Load the caller-owned order and lock it
REPO -> DB: SELECT order by id and customer, then SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
DB --> REPO: Order with its payments
REPO --> SV: Locked order
alt Order PENDING, paid by VNPAY, within 24 hours
SV -> REPO: Mark pending VNPAY attempts FAILED, insert a new PENDING attempt with a new vnp_TxnRef
REPO -> DB: UPDATE payments, INSERT payments
DB --> REPO: Persisted attempt
SV -> SV: Build the vnp_* parameters and sign them with HMAC-SHA512 (secret stays on the server)
SV --> CT: Payment link
CT --> SEC: 200 OK ApiResponse<VnpayPaymentResponse>
SEC --> A: 200 OK ApiResponse<VnpayPaymentResponse>
A -> VNPAY: Open paymentUrl
A -> VNPAY: Enter the test card and OTP
VNPAY -> CT: GET /api/v1/payments/vnpay/ipn (or /return) with signed vnp_* fields
CT -> SV: Handle the VNPAY result
SV -> SV: Verify the signature
SV -> REPO: Find the attempt by vnp_TxnRef and lock its order
REPO -> DB: SELECT payment, SELECT order FOR UPDATE
DB --> REPO: Attempt and order
REPO --> SV: Attempt and locked order
alt Signature, reference and amount valid, attempt still PENDING
SV -> REPO: Success code: attempt COMPLETED and order PAID, failure code: attempt FAILED
REPO -> DB: UPDATE payments (and orders)
DB --> REPO: Updated rows
SV --> CT: RspCode 00
else Already processed
SV --> CT: RspCode 02, nothing changed
else Invalid signature, unknown reference, or wrong amount
SV --> CT: RspCode 97, 01 or 04, nothing changed
end
CT --> VNPAY: IPN: 200 {"RspCode","Message"}
CT --> SEC: Return: 302 to the app URL with orderId and status
SEC --> A: Return: 302 to the app URL with orderId and status
A -> SEC: GET /api/v1/orders/{id}
activate SEC
note over SEC
validate the JWT and load AuthUser into the SecurityContext
end note
else Order not payable
SV --> CT: Propagate ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE
CT --> SEC: 409 ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE
SEC --> A: 409 ORDER_NOT_PAYABLE
end

@enduml
